00:12:57.980 --> 00:13:01.439
Please consider joining them and supporting
our mission of providing independent political

00:13:01.439 --> 00:13:02.439
coverage.

00:13:02.439 --> 00:13:03.949
And as always, I’ll see you in the next
video.

00:13:03.949 --> 00:13:04.209
Thanks for watching!

